      "text": "就在他 reflect, member of the law, and you are not the person."
    },
    {
      "end": 1033.14,
      "start": 1031.14,
      "text": "记得这一看我们读过来的"
    },
    {
      "end": 1035.34,
      "start": 1033.14,
      "text": "The barrister asked Christine McCartney"
    },
    {
      "end": 1036.5,
      "start": 1035.34,
      "text": "a few questions today"
    },
    {
      "end": 1038.04,
      "start": 1036.5,
      "text": "The player behind the seeds"
    },
    {
      "end": 1039.66,
      "start": 1038.04,
      "text": "that insisted we lock down our state"
    },
    {
      "end": 1041.82,
      "start": 1039.66,
      "text": "and mandate vaccines"
    },
    {
      "end": 1043.34,
      "start": 1041.82,
      "text": "is the only solution"
    },
    {
      "end": 1044.3,
      "start": 1043.34,
      "text": "Barrister"
    },
    {
      "end": 1047.44,
      "start": 1044.3,
      "text": "Is it true that double vaccinated people"
    },
    {
      "end": 1050.08,
      "start": 1047.44,
      "text": "are 13 times more likely"
    },
    {
      "end": 1052.46,
      "start": 1050.08,
      "text": "to catch and spread the virus"
    },
    {
      "end": 1053.6,
      "start": 1052.46,
      "text": "Christine"
    },
    {
      "end": 1054.76,
      "start": 1053.6,
      "text": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "end": 1056.06,
      "start": 1054.76,
      "text": "Barrister"
    },
    {
      "end": 1058.32,
      "start": 1056.06,
      "text": "Are vaccines dangerous at all"
    },
    {
      "end": 1059.24,
      "start": 1058.32,
      "text": "to pregnant women"
    },
    {
      "end": 1061.34,
      "start": 1059.24,
      "text": "or those planning to fall pregnant"
    },
    {
      "end": 1062.62,
      "start": 1061.34,
      "text": "Christine"
    },
    {
      "end": 1063.86,
      "start": 1062.62,
      "text": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "end": 1065.12,
      "start": 1063.86,
      "text": "Barrister"
    },
    {
      "end": 1066.96,
      "start": 1065.12,
      "text": "Is it true that the vaccines"
    },
    {
      "end": 1068.1,
      "start": 1066.96,
      "text": "have never been studied"
    },
    {
      "end": 1069.58,
      "start": 1068.1,
      "text": "for effectiveness and safety"
    },
    {
      "end": 1070.7,
      "start": 1069.58,
      "text": "Christine"
    },
    {
      "end": 1071.4,
      "start": 1070.7,
      "text": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "end": 1073.86,
      "start": 1071.4,
      "text": "They have never been fully studied"
    },
    {
      "end": 1074.54,
      "start": 1073.86,
      "text": "Okay"
    },
    {
      "end": 1076.32,
      "start": 1074.54,
      "text": "That is the questions"
    },
    {
      "end": 1078.04,
      "start": 1076.32,
      "text": "or those are the questions"
    },
    {
      "end": 1079.64,
      "start": 1078.04,
      "text": "and those are the answers"
    },
    {
      "end": 1081.52,
      "start": 1079.64,
      "text": "that were asked and answered"
    },
    {
      "end": 1082.9,
      "start": 1081.52,
      "text": "in court today"
    },
    {
      "end": 1083.66,
      "start": 1082.9,
      "text": "Okay"
    },
    {
      "end": 1085.48,
      "start": 1083.66,
      "text": "So as you can imagine"
    },
    {
      "end": 1087.98,
      "start": 1085.48,
      "text": "there are some very very serious"
    },
    {
      "end": 1090.3,
      "start": 1087.98,
      "text": "ramifications to those questions"
    },
    {
      "end": 1092.18,
      "start": 1090.3,
      "text": "and of course it's not surprising"
    },
    {
      "end": 1096.16,
      "start": 1092.18,
      "text": "that the media has not reported on those"
    },
    {
      "end": 1096.92,
      "start": 1096.16,
      "text": "Now"
    },
    {
      "end": 1097.94,
      "start": 1096.92,
      "text": "It's clear"
    },
    {
      "end": 1099.56,
      "start": 1097.94,
      "text": "I have to make this clear"
    },
    {
      "end": 1101.2,
      "start": 1099.56,
      "text": "The case is not over yet"
    },
    {
      "end": 1102.84,
      "start": 1101.2,
      "text": "there haven't been any rulings"
    },
    {
      "end": 1105.78,
      "start": 1102.84,
      "text": "but just those questions and answers already"
    },
    {
      "end": 1107.2,
      "start": 1105.78,
      "text": "and already those statements"
    },
    {
      "end": 1108.02,
      "start": 1107.2,
      "text": "that the media"
    },
    {
      "end": 1109.36,
      "start": 1108.02,
      "text": "are making"
    },
    {
      "end": 1110.16,
      "start": 1109.36,
      "text": "Okay"
    },
    {
      "end": 1112.0,
      "start": 1110.16,
      "text": "Speak volumes"
    },
    {
      "end": 1119.0,
      "start": 1112.0,
      "text": "Santa Claus is out of work due to vaccine requirements"
    },
    {
      "end": 1122.04,
      "start": 1119.0,
      "text": "A local man who portrays Santa was set to take on the role"
    },
    {
      "end": 1123.52,
      "start": 1122.04,
      "text": "and even had a contract"
    },
    {
      "end": 1125.64,
      "start": 1123.52,
      "text": "but now he has learned without a vaccine"
    },
    {
      "end": 1127.28,
      "start": 1125.64,
      "text": "he's on the naughty list"
    },
    {
      "end": 1129.4,
      "start": 1127.28,
      "text": "News4Jax reporter Jim Piggott talked with him"
    },
    {
      "end": 1132.38,
      "start": 1129.4,
      "text": "and shows us why Santa believes it's unfair"
    },
    {
      "end": 1135.38,
      "start": 1132.38,
      "text": "Vaccine mandates are creating a lot of concern"
    },
    {
      "end": 1136.64,
      "start": 1135.38,
      "text": "but for this man here"
    },
    {
      "end": 1138.44,
      "start": 1136.64,
      "text": "who really doesn't need an introduction"
    },
    {
      "end": 1141.44,
      "start": 1138.44,
      "text": "not being vaccinated is causing a problem"
    },
    {
      "end": 1142.6,
      "start": 1141.44,
      "text": "here's what's going on"
    },
    {
      "end": 1144.96,
      "start": 1142.6,
      "text": "but he just learned that one of his jobs was cancelled"
    },
    {
      "end": 1146.96,
      "start": 1144.96,
      "text": "because he's not vaccinated"
    },
    {
      "end": 1149.14,
      "start": 1146.96,
      "text": "it was a breakfast with Santa appearance"
    },
    {
      "end": 1150.88,
      "start": 1149.14,
      "text": "at Nordstrom's at the town center"
    },
    {
      "end": 1152.26,
      "start": 1150.88,
      "text": "for two days in December"
    },
    {
      "end": 1153.64,
      "start": 1152.26,
      "text": "he had a contract"
    },
    {
      "end": 1155.9,
      "start": 1153.64,
      "text": "but the booking firm out of Las Vegas called"
    },
    {
      "end": 1157.22,
      "start": 1155.9,
      "text": "and told him to stay home"
    },
    {
      "end": 1158.54,
      "start": 1157.22,
      "text": "she just told me that"
    },
    {
      "end": 1160.44,
      "start": 1158.54,
      "text": "she couldn't use me"
    },
    {
      "end": 1161.76,
      "start": 1160.44,
      "text": "she didn't want me showing up"
    },
    {
      "end": 1163.5,
      "start": 1161.76,
      "text": "on the 8th and the 11th"
    },
    {
      "end": 1164.64,
      "start": 1163.5,
      "text": "and being turned away"
    },
    {
      "end": 1167.32,
      "start": 1164.64,
      "text": "and not receiving pay"
    },
    {
      "end": 1169.42,
      "start": 1167.32,
      "text": "and there wasn't"
    },
    {
      "end": 1170.56,
      "start": 1169.42,
      "text": "there wouldn't be any face"
    },
    {
      "end": 1171.66,
      "start": 1170.56,
      "text": "he didn't offer to"
    },
    {
      "end": 1174.32,
      "start": 1171.66,
      "text": "honor the contract or anything"
    },
    {
      "end": 1175.76,
      "start": 1174.32,
      "text": "I checked with the firm"
    },
    {
      "end": 1177.06,
      "start": 1175.76,
      "text": "called Nationwide Santa"
    },
    {
      "end": 1178.24,
      "start": 1177.06,
      "text": "it had no comment"
    },
    {
      "end": 1180.64,
      "start": 1178.24,
      "text": "Ron says he learned that it was Nordstrom"
    },
    {
      "end": 1181.84,
      "start": 1180.64,
      "text": "that made the decision"
    },
    {
      "end": 1183.32,
      "start": 1181.84,
      "text": "Nordstrom has come back"
    },
    {
      "end": 1185.04,
      "start": 1183.32,
      "text": "and said that they want all their Santas"
    },
    {
      "end": 1185.94,
      "start": 1185.04,
      "text": "to be vaccinated"
    },
    {
      "end": 1188.24,
      "start": 1185.94,
      "text": "and that"
    },
    {
      "end": 1191.82,
      "start": 1188.24,
      "text": "those going to the event"
    },
    {
      "end": 1194.18,
      "start": 1191.82,
      "text": "that's what shocks me more than anything"
    },
    {
      "end": 1196.54,
      "start": 1194.18,
      "text": "that everybody going to the event"
    },
    {
      "end": 1198.22,
      "start": 1196.54,
      "text": "on the 8th and the 11th"
    },
    {
      "end": 1200.48,
      "start": 1198.22,
      "text": "will be required to be vaccinated"
    },
    {
      "end": 1204.56,
      "start": 1200.48,
      "text": "oh no no no no i want to say"
    },
    {
      "end": 1205.72,
      "start": 1204.56,
      "text": "yeah"
    },
    {
      "end": 1207.96,
      "start": 1205.72,
      "text": "yeah yeah yeah yeah"
    },
    {
      "end": 1209.88,
      "start": 1207.96,
      "text": "yeah yeah yeah"
    },
    {
      "end": 1211.7,
      "start": 1209.88,
      "text": "yeah yeah"
    },
    {
      "end": 1213.74,
      "start": 1211.7,
      "text": "yeah okay"
    },
    {
      "end": 1214.44,
      "start": 1213.74,
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "end": 1216.8,
      "start": 1214.44,
      "text": "you might give a talk"
    },
    {
      "end": 1219.48,
      "start": 1216.8,
      "text": "about why you come to the rally"
    },
    {
      "end": 1223.48,
      "start": 1219.48,
      "text": "如果我早就会有意义的,我会有意义的。"
    },
    {
      "end": 1225.48,
      "start": 1223.48,
      "text": "那不重要。"
    },
    {
      "end": 1230.48,
      "start": 1225.48,
      "text": "我会支持我的 rights,我会对我的选择。"
    },
    {
